    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA beautifully presented three-bedroom red brick mid-terrace residence enjoying a highly desirable position within this mature development.\n\n107 Castlefarm is an attractive red brick mid-terrace home that combines timeless kerb appeal with bright, well-proportioned accommodation, offering an excellent opportunity for families, first-time buyers and investors alike.\n\nUpon arrival, the property's handsome façade immediately creates a welcoming first impression. Internally, the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and benefits from an abundance of natural light throughout. The generous living spaces provide the perfect setting for both everyday family life and entertaining guests.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a delightful private garden, a wonderful outdoor retreat ideal for al fresco dining, children's play or simply relaxing in peaceful surroundings. The garden offers excellent potential for further landscaping while providing a valuable extension of the living accommodation during the warmer months.\n\nCastlefarm is a highly regarded residential development in the heart of Shankill, prized for its mature setting, excellent amenities and strong sense of community. Residents benefit from an impressive range of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities, all within easy reach.\nOne of the property's most attractive features is its outstanding connectivity. Shankill DART Station is conveniently located nearby, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding coastal suburbs. The area is also exceptionally well served by Dublin Bus routes, while the M11 and M50 road networks are within easy reach, ensuring seamless travel throughout Dublin and beyond. The picturesque coastline, Shanganagh Park, Cabinteely Park and the villages of Shankill and Bray further enhance the exceptional lifestyle offering on the doorstep.\n\n107 Castlefarm represents a rare opportunity to acquire a charming home in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations, where convenience, connectivity and community combine to create an exceptional place to live."
      },
      {
